  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760369,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 2 Game Pack! - Matchbox Missions - Emergency Response & Air, Land and Sea Rescue (GBA)\n\nRelive the excitement of the Matchbox toy lines with this double-pack adventure for the Game Boy Advance! *Matchbox Missions* combines two thrilling action/driving games: *Emergency Response* and *Air, Land, and Sea Rescue*. \n\nStep into the roles of heroic rescuers, tackling a variety of missions inspired by the iconic Matchbox vehicles. Drive police cars in high-speed chases, pilot helicopters to deliver vital supplies, and navigate challenging terrains in rescue trucks. Each game features a unique set of objectives, from apprehending criminals to saving those in need. \n\nExperience the charm and fast-paced gameplay of these beloved toy lines brought to life on your GBA. With a blend of driving, action, and rescue scenarios, *Matchbox Missions* offers hours of engaging fun for players of all ages. Published by Zoo Publishing in Europe and DSI Games elsewhere, this 2-in-1 pack delivers double the Matchbox action!"
    },
